ng adding a small whimsical daisy accent near the ear, with a yellow center and white petal spheres.\n\nI'm defining a reusable helper function for placing sphere-based decorations with configurable color and scale, then positioning the eyes symmetrically near the head's surface based on its width at that height.\n\nI'll adjust the eye position and scale it larger so it protrudes properly, then place pink cheek decals flattened against the head surface, add dark inner ears, and set body/head paint colors with a dark brown nose bulb and toes. I'm also sketching out a grey card texture and considering a dark brown mane detail, skipping the back stripe idea for now.\n\nI'll define the station and loft typing structure, then design a tufted SVG shape with a white fill and darker edge tint, and set up scatter logic to place hits across the body surface with minimum distance and a filter excluding the underside.\n\n",
